:: 214 [forest]
<p>This forest seems quite dark, even in the middle of the day. You follow the path deeper into the woods until you come to a split.</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[Go East.->215]]</li>
  <li>[[Go West.->216]]</li>
  <li>[[Leave the forest->c4]]</li>
</ul>

:: 215 [forest]
<p>The leaves of the trees crunch underfoot as you make your way further into the forest.</p>
<p>You have the eerie feeling that you're being watched.</p>
<p>Up ahead, a small path splits of to the right, headed South.</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[Continue on the path Southward.->217]]</li>
  <li>[[Follow the small path West.->218]]</li>
</ul>

:: 216 [forest]
<p>You walk a ways until the path fades into the ground. The branches are thick and it would be impossible to go on.</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[Turn around and go back to the entrance.->214]]</li>
</ul>


:: 223 [forest check]
<p>The path leads to a bramble of thorns and mushrooms. You have no choice but to turn around. The day grows longer and the forest gets darker.</p>
<p>Roll EMPATHY x GRIT.</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[12 or lower, you get lost on your way back to the path.->214]]</li>
  <li>[[...above 30, you find your way back to the path quickly.->222]]</li>
</ul>

:: 224 [forest]
<p>The sound of music greets your ears. At first, you're excited, but soon the song seems to shift and echo.</p>
<p>Where are you?</p>
<p>The path ahead splits again.</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[Go East.->225]]</li>
  <li>[[Go North.->226]]</li>
</ul>

:: 218 [forest]
<p>The path seems to double back on itself and you feel like you're going in circles. It ends abruptly, at the base of an imposing tree with a large crevice. Inside the hole, you find some charms and trainer coins.</p>
<div class='new-items'><strong>GAIN:</strong> 3 coins and 1 tool.</div>
<<set $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].backpack.coin += 3>>
<<set $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].backpack.tool += 1>>
<p>Now if only you could remember your way back...</p>
<p>Test ATTENTION x MEMORY</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[success: you find your way back to the path->217]]</li>
  <li>[[failure: you feel confused and lost->214]]</li>
</ul>

:: 221 [forest]
<p>A little bit of light shines through the canopy. You hope this is the right way.</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[Go West.->223]]</li>
  <li>[[Go East.->222]]</li>
</ul>

:: 217 [forest]
<p>The tree branches seem to reach down toward the path like arms.</p>
<p>You come to a four way intersection.</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[Go back the way you came, to the North.->215]]</li>
  <li>[[Go West.->220]]</li>
  <li>[[Go South.->220]]</li>
  <li>[[Go East.->221]]</li>
</ul>

:: 229 [forest]
<p>Your compass seems to fail you here. Which way do you go?</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[Go left.->228]]</li>
  <li>[[Go straight.->214]]</li>
  <li>[[Go right.->217]]</li>
</ul>

:: 220 [forest]
<p>This path looks familiar, you think. You come to a split.</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[Go East.->224]]</li>
  <li>[[Go West.->217]]</li>
</ul>

:: 225 [forest]
<p>You know you're close, but the path ahead has been blocked. If you had a ROOT Mergimal and knew how to CHOP, you could clear the path.
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[(requires keyword CHOP) Have your Mergimal chop the fallen tree.->228]]</li>
  <li>[[Turn around.->224]]</li>
</ul>

:: 222 [forest test]
<p>The birds have stopped chirping. Even the sound of your footsteps seems muted. A crack of a twig behind you startles you.</p>
<p>Roll ATTENTION x GRIT.</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[roll ≤ 30: You trip and fall into a pile of thorns. Gain an injury.->229]]</li>
  <li>[[roll > 30: You keep yourself steady and don't let the spooky sounds frighten you.->229]]</li>
</ul>

:: 226 [forest encounter]
<p>A little person with a long beard and pointy hat sits on a mushroom, drinking tea. A tiny pig-like Mergimal sits next to them with a cup of their own.</p>
<<numberbox "$asilCode" 0 autofocus>>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[What's the code?->asil]]</li>
  <li>[[Nevermind.->224]]</li>
</ul>

:: 228 [transition]
<<if !$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].keywords.includes('chop')>>
  <p>You don't have a Mergimal that could chop this tree down.</p>
  <ul class='choices'>
    <li><<return 'Go back.'>></li>
  </ul>
<<else>>
  <p>Your Mergimal chops the tree.</p>
  <p>You continue along the path and emerge in Littlemoose!</p>
  <ul class='choices'>
    <li>[[Explore Littlemoose.->d6]]</li>
  </ul>
<</if>>